<figure class="figure"><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202404/heygen-ai-avatar/images/heygen-ai-avatar-31.webp" width="1400" height="319" alt="林鼎淵著作《ChatGPT 與 AI 繪圖效率大師（新增 Copilot、Gamma、Runway、Suno）》" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
